 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In London,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 0.759
  },
  {
   "text": "a street once drowned.",
   "s": 0.941,
   "e": 2.354
  },
  {
   "text": "In beer.",
   "s": 2.835,
   "e": 3.529
  },
  {
   "text": "It's October,",
   "s": 4.223,
   "e": 4.94
  },
  {
   "text": "eighteen fourteen.",
   "s": 5.192,
   "e": 6.21
  },
  {
   "text": "At the Horse Shoe Brewery, giant wooden vats tower over the workers.",
   "s": 6.737,
   "e": 10.753
  },
  {
   "text": "The biggest is twenty-two feet tall,",
   "s": 11.132,
   "e": 13.221
  },
  {
   "text": "packed with dark porter.",
   "s": 13.506,
   "e": 14.806
  },
  {
   "text": "Iron hoops hold each vat together,",
   "s": 15.251,
   "e": 17.179
  },
  {
   "text": "like belts on a very fat barrel.",
   "s": 17.414,
   "e": 19.478
  },
  {
   "text": "One afternoon, a clerk notices a hoop has slipped.",
   "s": 19.974,
   "e": 22.671
  },
  {
   "text": "Just a few inches.",
   "s": 23.018,
   "e": 23.935
  },
  {
   "text": "His boss shrugs.",
   "s": 24.349,
   "e": 25.247
  },
  {
   "text": "\"They slip all the time.\"",
   "s": 25.642,
   "e": 26.587
  },
  {
   "text": "An hour later,",
   "s": 27.163,
   "e": 27.97
  },
  {
   "text": "the hoop snaps.",
   "s": 28.177,
   "e": 29.219
  },
  {
   "text": "The vat bursts open.",
   "s": 29.529,
   "e": 30.825
  },
  {
   "text": "The wave smashes the next vat,",
   "s": 31.306,
   "e": 32.981
  },
  {
   "text": "and that one gives way too.",
   "s": 33.203,
   "e": 34.48
  },
  {
   "text": "Hundreds of thousands of gallons roar straight through the back wall.",
   "s": 34.899,
   "e": 38.581
  },
  {
   "text": "The beer floods the poor streets of St Giles,",
   "s": 39.037,
   "e": 41.649
  },
  {
   "text": "pouring into cellars where whole families live.",
   "s": 41.853,
   "e": 44.24
  },
  {
   "text": "Rescuers wade in up to their waists, digging through the rubble.",
   "s": 44.722,
   "e": 47.842
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight people lose their lives that day.",
   "s": 48.349,
   "e": 50.177
  },
  {
   "text": "So who pays?",
   "s": 50.835,
   "e": 51.862
  },
  {
   "text": "The court looks at the brewery,",
   "s": 52.371,
   "e": 53.76
  },
  {
   "text": "the broken hoop,",
   "s": 53.998,
   "e": 54.697
  },
  {
   "text": "the shrugging boss,",
   "s": 55.036,
   "e": 56.05
  },
  {
   "text": "and calls it an act of God.",
   "s": 56.319,
   "e": 58.036
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody is to blame.",
   "s": 58.433,
   "e": 59.334
  },
  {
   "text": "And the brewery?",
   "s": 59.884,
   "e": 60.556
  },
  {
   "text": "It asks the government for the tax it paid on all that lost beer.",
   "s": 61.011,
   "e": 64.223
  },
  {
   "text": "And gets it back.",
   "s": 64.65,
   "e": 65.681
  }
 ]
}